The Runaway Loaf — Lemo-Opuscar · 1920s Silent Film demo
LemoLab × Claude Opus 5.5

Picture: everything drawn in code (Canvas2D tonal painting → WebGL2 ink redraw → WebGL2 film-print post), no generated images.
Story, characters, score and sound design: original (Lemo-Opuscar). No narration; intertitles only.

