    ★ NOT SHIPPED IN THIS REPOSITORY: this file is not in git and no in-repo script can fetch it.
      The two paths that read it (frames.js:119, sheets.js:28) attach only `onload`, never `onerror` —
      so a 404 hangs them instead of failing, and neither path can run as-is.

